oneOf.description:
Data keys were set or deleted (`data_get` reads them): every key
changed since the last such event, at most 20 events a second;
`revision` is the store's after them.

fullscreen.description:
`true`: full screen on `display` (the main display if absent);
`false`: in a window. Absent: where the same view was last (a
window the first time), or full screen if `display` is given.

